NAME
    gcloud alpha apihub discovered-api-observations discovered-api-operations -
        manage Discovered Api Operation resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha apihub discovered-api-observations discovered-api-operations
        COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage Discovered Api Operation resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (ALPHA) Describe a Discovered Api Operation.

     list
        (ALPHA) List Discovered Api Operations.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist. This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud apihub discovered-api-observations discovered-api-operations

